**/.hg
**/keys
**/node_modules
# drawlatch formats only `src/**/*.ts` and its top-level `*.{json,ts,js}` (its
# own `format` script, with packages/drawlatch/.prettierrc). Prettier run from
# here resolves that .prettierrc for every drawlatch file, so without these the
# root `prettier` script, lint-staged and format-on-save would rewrite files
# drawlatch never formatted: its frontend (written double-quoted), the
# hand-formatted connection templates, fixtures, bin and editor config.
packages/drawlatch/frontend/
packages/drawlatch/bin/
packages/drawlatch/src/connections/
packages/drawlatch/src/**/__fixtures__/
packages/drawlatch/.vscode/
packages/drawlatch/.claude-plugin/
